#: ../../site/migration.md:24
msgid "Porting checklist"
msgstr "迁移检查清单"

#: ../../site/migration.md:26
msgid ""
"**Find the native symbol.** Every public symbol is in the API ledger; if a "
"Python call has no native counterpart, it is not implemented, and a wrapper "
"that pretends otherwise will drift."
msgstr "**找到原生符号。** 每个公共符号都在 API 清单里；若某个 Python 调用没有原生对应物，那就是未实现，假装实现的包装层迟早会漂移。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:29
msgid ""
"**Check the unit contract.** Native functions take decimal returns, not "
"percentages, and never convert units implicitly."
msgstr "**检查单位契约。** 原生函数接受小数收益而不是百分比，且从不做隐式换算。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:31
msgid ""
"**Check the alignment contract.** Pairwise APIs join on shared timestamps; "
"strict ones reject duplicated or unsorted indexes. A Python query that "
"relied on positional order must be rewritten, not translated."
msgstr "**检查对齐契约。** 成对 API 按共有时间戳连接；严格 API 会拒绝重复或乱序索引。依赖位置顺序的 Python 查询必须重写，而不是直译。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:34
msgid ""
"**Check the failure contract.** A `NaN` result and an exception mean "
"different things here; see [conventions](conventions.md)."
msgstr "**检查失败契约。** 这里的 `NaN` 结果与异常含义不同；见[约定](conventions.md)。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:36
msgid ""
"**Keep the oracle budget.** Reuse the same fixture and the same reference "
"values you used in Python, so a port is verified against evidence rather "
"than against itself."
msgstr "**保留 oracle 预算。** 复用你在 Python 里用的同一 fixture 与参考值，这样移植是对照证据验证，而不是自我验证。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:40
msgid "Known differences that bite"
msgstr "容易踩到的已知差异"

#: ../../site/migration.md:42
msgid ""
"**Signed zero and NaN payloads.** Digests serialize doubles as IEEE-754 bit "
"patterns; some writers normalize negative zero because the bytes are hashed."
msgstr "**带符号零与 NaN 载荷。** 摘要把浮点序列化为 IEEE-754 位模式；部分写出器会规范负零，因为字节会被哈希。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:44
msgid ""
"**Annualization defaults.** 252 for daily. A Python helper that used 365 "
"will disagree by the square root of the ratio."
msgstr "**年化默认值。** 日频为 252。用 365 的 Python 辅助函数会相差该比值的平方根。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:46
msgid ""
"**Deviation divisor.** `calc_distribution_stats` reports the population "
"deviation, while pandas defaults to `ddof=1`; the difference is visible on "
"short samples and vanishes only asymptotically. It also does not filter "
"`NaN`."
msgstr ""
"**偏差除数。** `calc_distribution_stats` 报告总体偏差，而 pandas 默认 "
"`ddof=1`；短样本上差异可见，只有渐近才消失。它也不过滤 `NaN`。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:49
msgid ""
"**Drawdown signs.** `max_drawdown` returns a negative fraction, while "
"`gen_drawdown_table` reports a positive percentage of the prior peak."
msgstr "**回撤符号。** `max_drawdown` 返回负数小数，而 `gen_drawdown_table` 报告相对前高的正百分比。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:51
msgid ""
"**Backtest verdicts.** `inconclusive` is a real outcome, not a failure; the "
"five-expected-exception floor is applied on purpose."
msgstr "**回测结论。** `inconclusive` 是真实结果而不是失败；五期望例外的下限是刻意设置的。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:53
msgid ""
"**Optional routes.** Provider or extension surfaces marked optional are not "
"parity claims. The iteration records list what is implemented and what is "
"deferred."
msgstr "**可选路径。** 标记为可选的 provider 或扩展接口不是 parity 承诺。迭代记录列出了已实现与推迟的部分。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:57
msgid "What parity means here"
msgstr "这里的 parity 指什么"

#: ../../site/migration.md:59
msgid ""
"The repository's parity records describe the implemented native surface and "
"its declared variances. The iteration-8 record is the authoritative scope "
"snapshot; later performance work does not retroactively expand it. Check the"
" dated acceptance records for dependency and platform status rather than "
"inferring it from a phase count."
msgstr ""
"仓库的 parity 记录描述已实现的原生接口及其声明的差异。迭代 8 "
"的记录是权威范围快照；后续性能工作不会追溯扩大它。依赖与平台状态请查有日期的验收记录，而不是从阶段编号推断。"

#: ../../site/migration.md:65
msgid ""
"For a migration review, map each Python call to a public native symbol, "
"verify its unit and alignment contract, and retain the same fixture or "
"oracle budget. A port that changes both the code and the reference values "
"proves nothing."
msgstr ""
"做迁移评审时，把每个 Python 调用映射到公共原生符号，验证其单位与对齐契约，并保留同样的 fixture 或 oracle "
"预算。同时改动代码与参考值的移植什么也证明不了。"

